\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the proposed SINNE-KF-aided navigation framework. A sliding window of recent inertial measurements is processed by SINNE-KF to estimate the inertial sensor noise standard deviations, which are then used to adapt the process noise covariance matrix of the selected navigation filter (EKF, UKF, or RI-IKF). In parallel, the raw inertial and DVL measurements are directly fused by the navigation filtering framework for state estimation.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
